  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Changes since 1.0.1: add 1D/3D .cube LUT color grading with adjustable strength across CPU, AVX2 SIMD, and ILGPU; add Clarity, AutoAdjust strength, and exposed image-analysis results; improve camera-response recovery and motion masking; add camera-response output encoding and timestamp-based HDR series grouping; fix HDR White Clip brightness discontinuities and SIMD radiance maps for partial vector rows; expand regression coverage; replace the package icon with a two-color design. See README.md for details.",
